# CVE-2026-47884 — CRITICAL — org.springframework:spring-webmvc
# Fixed in spring-webmvc 7.0.9 (Spring Framework 7.x) only.
# Spring Framework 7.x requires Spring Boot 4.x, which requires Java 21.
# transaction-service currently targets Java 17; Java 21 migration is tracked separately.
# Accepted risk: this CVE requires an XsltView-based endpoint to be exploitable,
# which transaction-service does not expose.
# TODO: remove this entry once transaction-service is migrated to Java 21 + Spring Boot 4.x.
